 "story": "Liverpool lost 2-3 to Fenerbahçe in the Champions League at Şükrü Saracoğlu Stadium. Trey Nyoni gave Liverpool the lead in the 25th minute, but Mason Greenwood equalised four minutes later. Alexander Isak restored Liverpool's advantage in the 69th minute, assisted by Cody Gakpo, before Archie Brown and Vedat Muriqi scored for Fenerbahçe in the 73rd and 79th minutes. The defeat leaves Liverpool eighth of 36 teams in the Champions League table with nine points from four matches.",
